                                                "sense_id": "d1c3affe-6afe-3866-9ecd-d33921f0bbae",
                                                "text": "I have been unable to find out if these are linked in some way to the 1945 Budapest hippos, with the possibility this would create of a parallel history of Central Europe seen through the endurance of one brave African artiodactyl family."
                                            }
